      en: ["The cinema was opened in 1937 under the direction of architect Bruno Sclafani.", "The facade is completely clad in the finest Carrara marble.", "It is located on Sematat Avenue, a major thoroughfare in Asmara.", "The cinema underwent extensive renovation in 2004, preserving the original design.", "The auditorium has a seating capacity for several hundred visitors on two levels.", "Asmara is often called 'La Piccola Roma' because of buildings like this one."],
